<DocsLayout title="FxTune - Privacy Policy" activeDoc="privacy">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p><em>Last updated: September 13, 2026</em></p>

    <p>
      FxTune ("we", "our", or "us") operates the FxTune mobile application (the "App"). This page
      informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal
      information when you use our App.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information Collection and Use</h2>

    <h3>Local-First Architecture</h3>
    <p>
      FxTune is designed as a <strong>local-first application</strong>. All audio recordings, projects,
      and user data are stored locally on your device. We do not have access to your audio content
      or creative work.
    </p>

    <h3>Data We Do NOT Collect</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Audio recordings or music projects</li>
      <li>Microphone input data (processed locally only)</li>
      <li>User-generated content</li>
      <li>Account information (no account required)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Data We Collect</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Usage Analytics:</strong> Anonymous app usage statistics to improve the App</li>
      <li><strong>Crash Reports:</strong> Technical crash data to fix bugs (via Firebase Crashlytics)</li>
      <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Device model, OS version, and audio capabilities for optimization</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Third-Party Services</h2>

    <p>The App uses the following third-party services:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Firebase Crashlytics</strong> — Crash reporting
        (<a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          >Privacy Policy</a
        >)
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>RevenueCat</strong> — In-app purchase management
        (<a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          >Privacy Policy</a
        >)
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Google AdMob</strong> — Advertising (optional, can be disabled)
        (<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          >Privacy Policy</a
        >)
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Audio and Microphone Data</h2>

    <p>
      FxTune requires microphone access to function. <strong>All audio processing occurs entirely
      on your device</strong> using our native C++ audio engine. No audio data is transmitted to
      external servers.
    </p>

    <p>The microphone permission is used for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Recording audio input</li>
      <li>Real-time audio analysis and visualization</li>
      <li>AI-powered performance coaching (processed locally)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Cloud Sync (Optional)</h2>

    <p>
      If you enable Cloud Sync, your project data is encrypted and stored on our secure servers.
      This feature is entirely optional and can be disabled at any time.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Data is encrypted in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256)</li>
      <li>You can delete your cloud data at any time from the App settings</li>
      <li>We do not access or analyze your cloud-stored content</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Children's Privacy</h2>

    <p>
      Our App does not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally
      identifiable information from children under 13.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>

    <p>
      We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by
      posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>

    <p>
      If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Email:</strong> privacy@fxtune.app<br />
      <strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://fxtune.app">https://fxtune.app</a>
    </p>

    <h2>8. GDPR Compliance (EU Users)</h2>

    <p>For users in the European Union:</p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Data Controller:</strong> FxTune</li>
      <li><strong>Legal Basis:</strong> Legitimate interest (app functionality and improvement)</li>
      <li><strong>Data Retention:</strong> Analytics data is retained for 26 months</li>
      <li><strong>Your Rights:</strong> Access, rectification, erasure, data portability</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact:</strong> privacy@fxtune.app for any GDPR-related requests
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. California Residents (CCPA)</h2>

    <p>If you are a California resident, you have the right to:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Know what personal information is being collected</li>
      <li>Request deletion of your personal information</li>
      <li>Opt-out of the sale of your personal information (we do not sell data)</li>
      <li>Non-discrimination for exercising your privacy rights</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
